":false,"_score_rev_volatility":19.9,"_gate_margin_vs_hist":0.9192825619742924,"_gp_margin_vs_hist":false,"_score_margin_vs_hist":0.0,"_gate_piotroski":3,"_gp_piotroski":false,"_score_piotroski":33.3,"_gate_spread":null,"_gp_spread":null,"_score_spread":null,"_gate_roic_consistency":null,"_gp_roic_consistency":null,"_score_roic_consistency":null,"_gate_incr_roic":null,"_gp_incr_roic":null,"_score_incr_roic":null,"_gate_margin_advantage":null,"_gp_margin_advantage":null,"_score_margin_advantage":null,"_gate_pool_share":null,"_gp_pool_share":null,"_score_pool_share":null,"_gate_rev_durability":null,"_gp_rev_durability":null,"_score_rev_durability":0.0,"_gate_fcf_durability":null,"_gp_fcf_durability":null,"_score_fcf_durability":null,"_gate_margins":null,"_gp_margins":null,"_score_margins":null,"_gate_fund_growth":null,"_gp_fund_growth":null,"_score_fund_growth":null,"_gate_shrhldr_yield":0.00896254677086778,"_gp_shrhldr_yield":false,"_score_shrhldr_yield":21.1,"_gate_share_shrink":null,"_gp_share_shrink":null,"_score_share_shrink":0.0,"_gate_sbc_dilution":0.06818689917281466,"_gp_sbc_dilution":false,"_score_sbc_dilution":0.0,"_gate_insider_own":0.00954,"_gp_insider_own":false,"_score_insider_own":6.4,"_gate_insider_buying":0.0,"_gp_insider_buying":false,"_score_insider_buying":0.0,"pf":[],"description_full":"Robinhood Markets, Inc. operates financial services platform in the United States. The company's platform allows users to invest in stocks, exchange-traded funds (ETFs), and American depository receipts. It offers fractional trading, recurring investments, access to investing on margin, fully-paid securities lending, cash sweep, instant withdrawals, retirement program, around-the-clock trading, joint investing accounts, event contracts, future contract services, and short selling. The company also provides various learning and education solutions comprise Snacks, an accessible digest of business news stories for a new generation of investors; Learn, which is an online collection of guides, feature tutorials, and financial dictionary; Newsfeeds that offer access to free, premium news from sites from various sites, such as Barron's, Reuters, and Dow Jones. In addition, the company offers In-App Education, a resource that covers investing fundamentals, including why people invest, a stock market overview, and tips on how to define investing goals, as well as allows customers to understand the basics of investing before their first trade; and Crypto Learn and Earn, an educational module available to various crypto customers through Robinhood Learn to teach customers the basics related to cryptocurrency. Further, it provides Robinhood credit cards, cash card and spending accounts, and wallets. Robinhood Markets, Inc. was incorporated in 2013 and is headquartered in Menlo Park, California.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Vladimir  Tenev | Co-Founder, President, CEO & Chairman of the Board | Age 38 | Compensation: $3.0M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 2K people. Revenue per employee of $1.5M ranks in the top quartile among Financial Services peers, improving at 25%/yr \u2014 growing workforce leverage. Each employee generates $560K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $105K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 2\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (9/10).","financial_summary":["Robinhood Markets, Inc. is a large-cap financial services business with a $72.9B market cap on $4.5B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +49% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder. Operating margins are expanding by +62.5pp year-over-year, which is one of the strongest signals that the moat is deepening.","Returns on capital run at -43% against a 13% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","The business throws off $1.6B in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 36 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, with adequate 0.87\u00d7 cash conversion.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and interest coverage of 68\u00d7 is fortress-like.","Shareholder yield is only 0.9%, a thin return of capital, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome, and within its sector the business captures 1.8\u00d7 its fair share of profits, a structural advantage visible in the numbers."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 3/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom decile among Financial Services peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"red","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Price sits 17% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.1660145103634731},{"text":"Altman Z in the grey zone \u2014 financial health warrants monitoring","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $54.9M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Financial Services peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Operating margins 18% above sector median \u2014 the quantitative trace of pricing power","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Growing faster than most Financial Services peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Recent Analysts\u2019 Ratings Updates for Robinhood Markets (HOOD)","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/06/recent-analysts-ratings-updates-for-robinhood-markets-hood.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793998612.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.052,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"12,304 Robinhood Markets, Inc. $HOOD Shares Purchased by Rakuten Investment Management Inc.","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/05/12304-robinhood-markets-inc-hood-shares-purchased-by-rakuten-investment-management-inc.html","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793876030.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.878,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Why Did Robinhood (NASDAQ:HOOD) Slip After A Record?","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/stocks/technical-analysis/why-did-robinhood-nasdaqhood-slip-after-a-record","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793839140.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"SoFi Stock Is Down 50% From Its High. Here's Why I'd Buy It Right Now","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/sofi-stock-down-50-high-165702000.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793984610.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.151,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Robinhood Made $173 Million From Prediction Markets Last Quarter, More Than From Crypto. Can That Carry the Stock?","source":"